oníbàárà náà ngbọ́kàn lé iye àti ìdájọ́ oǹtajà náà láti ṣa àwọn ọjà tó tọ́.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Oǹtajà mọ ìdi náà pàtó tí oníbàárà náà yíò fi àwon ọjà náà ṣe ontaja naa si jẹ́ oníṣòwò ògbóntàrigì nínu títà àti ríra irú ọjà bẹ́ẹ̀.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Oǹtajà mọ ìdí náà pàtó tí oníbàárà náà yíò fi àwọn ọjà náà ṣe àtipé ó mọ̀ pé oníbàárà náà ngbọ́kàn lé iye àti ìdájọ́ oǹtajà náà láti ṣa àwọn ọjà tó tọ́. [Subject: Professional Accounting · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>df3423cd381ebf3904bb...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124238 · SUBHISTWOR_Q509082</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_HIST_WORLD — World History (Modern World, Revolutions, World Wars &amp; Decolonization)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div clas