</details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124237 · SUBHISTWOR_Q509081</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_HIST_WORLD — World History (Modern World, Revolutions, World Wars &amp; Decolonization)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Civil Services &amp; GS</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Prehistory (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Prehistory</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Kí ni wọ́n parí nínú ìwádìí kan lẹ́nu àìpẹ́ yìí tí ó ń ṣe àfiwé àkójọpọ̀ àwọn ènìyàn òde òní pẹ̀lú àwọn òkú egungun àtijọ́ ní Àríwá àti Gúúsù Amẹ́ríkà?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àwọn ọmọ ìbílẹ̀ Amẹ́ríkà ní Àríwá Amẹ́ríkà àti Gúúsù Amẹ́ríkà yàtọ̀ sí ara wọn àti àwọn baba ńlá wọn ní àríwá ní nkan bí ẹgbẹ̀rún lọ́nà 30,000 ọdún sẹ́yìn.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Gbogbo àwọn ọmọ ìbílẹ̀ Amẹ́ríkà, àtijọ́ àti ìgbàlódé, ni wọ́n wá láti ìṣípòpọ̀ austral-Melanesians kan ṣoṣo sí Amẹ́ríkà ní nkan bí ọdún 13,000 sẹ́yìn.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Gbogbo àwọn ọmọ ìbílẹ̀ Amẹ́ríkà, àtijọ́ àti ìgbàlódé, ni wọ́n wá láti inú ìṣípòpọ̀ kan ṣoṣo ti Inuit, tí wọ́n dé Amẹ́ríkà ní nkan bí ọdún 13,000 sẹ́yìn.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ìyàsọ́tọ̀ láàárín àwọn ará Siberia ìbílẹ̀ àti àwọn ọmọ ìbílẹ̀ Amẹ́ríkà àkọ́kọ́ ṣẹlẹ̀ láàárín ọdún 20,000 sí 23,000 sẹ́yìn.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Ìyàsọ́tọ̀ láàárín àwọn ará Siberia ìbílẹ̀ àti àwọn ọmọ ìbílẹ̀ Amẹ́ríkà àkọ́kọ́ ṣẹlẹ̀ láàárín ọdún 20,000 sí 23,000 sẹ́yìn. [Subject: Prehistory · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>1b12d6904014cf43673e...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124236 · SUBGENCORE_Q509064</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Nutrition</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Nutrition (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Nutrition</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Kini awọn ipa ti agbaye lori aabo ounje?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn ifunni awọn orilẹ-ede ọlọrọ ati awọn idena iṣowo jẹ ki o ṣoro fun awọn orilẹ-ede to sese ndagbasoke lati lo anfani ti agbara agbaye fun ilọsiwaju aabo ounjẹ.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn ofin ti Eto Iṣowo Agbaye ko ni aabo iṣẹ-ogbin, nitorinaa agbaye ko ni ipa lori aabo ounje.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn ile itaja nla jẹ ọna kan ṣoṣo ti ounjẹ ati iṣẹ-ogbin ti ni iriri agbaye.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn orilẹ-ede to sese ndagbasoke nilo lati ṣẹda awọn ifiṣura ounjẹ ti gbogbo eniyan lati le mọ awọn anfani ti o pọju.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Awọn ifunni awọn orilẹ-ede ọlọrọ ati awọn idena iṣowo jẹ ki o ṣoro fun awọn orilẹ-ede to sese ndagbasoke lati lo anfani ti agbara agbaye fun ilọsiwaju aabo ounjẹ. [Subject: Nutrition · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>15e30c7422bc80277dc8...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124235 · SUBGENCORE_Q509057</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Nutrition</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Nutrition (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Nutrition</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Gbólóhùn ẹyọkan wo nipa tito nkan lẹsẹsẹ ọra ati gbigba jẹ deede?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Gbigba awọn asidi fatty ninu ifun waye nipataki nipasẹ FABP ati awọn ọlọjẹ gbigbe FAT/CD36 ninu awọn enterocytes ti duodenum jijin.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Lẹhin gbigba, alabọde pq triglycerides (MCT) wọ inu eto lymphatic, lakoko ti awọn triglycerides pq gigun wọ inu eto ẹjẹ ẹnu-ọna.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn ọja ti tito nkan lẹsẹsẹ ti awọn triglycerides (triacylglycerol) le ṣẹda awọn micelles ti a dapọ pẹlu idaabobo awọ pancreatic ati awọn phospholipids ati pe eyi pọ si gbigba.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Triglycerides (triacylglycerol) gbọdọ jẹ emulsified ati digested ṣaaju ki o to gbe awọn acids fatty le gbe.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Triglycerides (triacylglycerol) gbọdọ jẹ emulsified ati digested ṣaaju ki o to gbe awọn acids fatty le gbe. [Subject: Nutrition · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>847e9cd97fb6c1f6f58c...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124234 · SUBGENCORE_Q509039</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Miscellaneous</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Miscellaneous (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Miscellaneous</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Láti ìgbà ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀pẹ̀, Mo kọwé láti ṣe àlàye ìgbésí ayé mi fún ara mí, tí mo sì pe èyíkéyìi ònkàwé láti dárapọ̀ mọ́ mi lórí okùn tó wà lókè. Mo máa ṣiṣẹ́ láì lo àwọ̀n kankan àti láìsí ariwo àwọn èèrò láti dàmiláàmú. Wíwo ilẹ̀ láti òkè ńmú òòyì kọ́ mi. ó ńtọnisọ́nà. Mi ò ní àkọọ́lẹ̀ àgbáyé ní bí ó ti wá fún mi ní pàtó ṣùgbọ́n mo yíi padà nìpasẹ̀ mímú kí ó gba prísíìmu àwọn ìtàn tó yááyì tí mo ti ṣe àkójọ rẹ̀ ní ọ̀nà tí lepidopterist fí ńtọ́jú àfòpiná alárà inú klórófọ́ọ̀mù rẹ̀ pamọ, tàbí àwọn Beetle láti Costa Rica. Àwọn ìtàn rì bíi ohun èèlò tí mò ńlò láti fi ṣe ìtumọ̀ sí ara mi. ----------Pat Conroy Èwo nínú àwọn wọ̀nyí ló ṣe àpèjúwe títò ti abala yí dáradára jùlọ?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ònkọ̀wé náà ńpèsè àwọn àlàyé lóríṣiríṣi fún gbígbé àwọn ìgbésẹ̀ kan nípàtó.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Òǹkọ̀wé náà ńlo àwọn àkàwé láti ṣe àlàyé àwọn ìrírí rẹ̀ ní ti ìgbésẹ̀ kan nìpàtó.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ònkọ̀wé náà ńṣe àfiwé láàrin àwọn ìrírí rẹ̀ àti ti àwọn yòókù nínú iṣẹ́ tirẹ̀.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Òǹkọ̀wé kan ṣe átòkalẹ̀ àwọn ipele lóríṣiríṣi ti iṣẹ́ rẹ̀ nínú iṣẹ́ kan ní pàtó.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) Òǹkọ̀wé náà ńlo àwọn àkàwé láti ṣe àlàyé àwọn ìrírí rẹ̀ ní ti ìgbésẹ̀ kan nìpàtó. [Subject: Miscellaneous · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>76936317ea8f88bbd69d...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124233 · SUBGENCORE_Q509018</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Miscellaneous</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Miscellaneous (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Miscellaneous</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Èwo nínú àwọn wọ̀nyí ni ó fa ọgbọ́n yọ jùlọ fún òṣèré tí iṣẹ́ rẹ̀ níílò wípé kí ó lo ohun àmúlò tó léwu kan ní pàtó?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ṣíṣàwárí ohun àmúlò tí kò léwu láti lò àti ṣíṣe àyípadà ètò ṣíṣe-ọnà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ó ti ṣe kókó</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kíka àlẹ̀mọ́ lára ohun àmúlò náà kí á sì tẹ̀síwájú gẹ́gẹ́ bíi ìdarí lára àlẹ̀mọ́ náà</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ṣíṣe àrídájú wípé kò sí ọmọdé kankan níbẹ̀ nígbàti a bá ńlo ohun àmúlò náà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Bíbèèrè lọ́wọ́ akọ́ṣẹ́mọṣẹ́ onímọ̀ nípa ewu ṣáájú lílo ohun èèlò náà</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) Kíka àlẹ̀mọ́ lára ohun àmúlò náà kí á sì tẹ̀síwájú gẹ́gẹ́ bíi ìdarí lára àlẹ̀mọ́ náà [Subject: Miscellaneous · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>afed44072404a578b59d...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124232 · SUBGENCORE_Q508969</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Logical Fallacies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Logical Fallacies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Logical Fallacies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Fálásì àròkọ ni</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">ó ńfi okùnfà ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ sí okùnfà ìrọ̀rùn kan nígbàtí okùnfà náà ti pẹ̀ka</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">ṣíṣe àríyànjiyàn wípé ohun tó jẹ́ òtítọ́ nípa apá kan ohun kan gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ òtítọ́ nípa gbogbo ara nǹkan náà</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">ó parí ọrọ̀ láì ní ẹ̀rí tó péye láti ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún ìparí ọ̀rọ̀ náà</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">ó parí ọrọ̀ tó dá lóri ríro èrò àkọlé ìbùwọ́lù nígbàtí kò dìídì ní àjọṣepọ̀ tààrà kankan láàrin ìbùwọ́lù àfẹnujẹ́ àti àkòrí ọrọ̀ ìparí náà</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) ṣíṣe àríyànjiyàn wípé ohun tó jẹ́ òtítọ́ nípa apá kan ohun kan gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ òtítọ́ nípa gbogbo ara nǹkan náà [Subject: Logical Fallacies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>274054f89705704a1ed2...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124231 · SUBGENCORE_Q508967</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Jurisprudence</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Glo