-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Nígbà tí a kò bá ṣe é lòdì sí ọkọ̀ ojú omi mìíràn àti nígbà tí a kò bá ṣe àdéhùn fún &#x27;òpin aládàáni&#x27;</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Nígbà tí a kò bá ṣe é lòdì sí ọkọ̀ ojú omi mìíràn àti nígbà tí a kò bá ṣe àdéhùn fún &#x27;òpin aládàáni&#x27; [Subject: International Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>cf8e08d3e3ce51b21418...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124228 · SUBLAWCONS_Q508957</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_LAW_CONST — Constitutional &amp; Administrative Law</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Law</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> International Law (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> International Law</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Kí ni ìyàtọ̀ láàrin ìṣèlú àti ọ̀nà òfin fún ìpinnu àríyànjiyàn?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àbájáde tí ó wáyé láti inú àwọn ọ̀nà òfin, ìdájọ́ ie tàbí ìdájọ́ láti ọwọ́ ICJ, jẹ́ ìkẹyìn àti ìsopọ̀ lórí àwọn ẹgbẹ́, nígbà tí èyí kò rí bẹ́ẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àwọn ọ̀nà ìjọba.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àwọn ọ̀nà òṣèlú ni wọ́n ń lépa lórí ìfọwọ́sowọ́pọ̀ àwọn ẹgbẹ́ nígbà náà sí àríyànjiyàn náà, nígbà tí àwọn ọ̀nà òfin kò gbà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ọ̀nà òṣèlú yọrí sí ìpinnu ìkẹyìn àríyànjiyàn náà, nígbà tí èyí kò rí bẹ́ẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àwọn ọ̀nà òfin.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àwọn ọ̀nà òfin ìpinnu àríyànjiyàn ni wọ́n ń lépa nípa àwọn àríyànjiyàn ńlá nìkan, nígbà tí àwọn ọ̀nà òṣèlú wà ní iṣẹ́ nínú gbogbo àríyànjiyàn.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Àbájáde tí ó wáyé láti inú àwọn ọ̀nà òfin, ìdájọ́ ie tàbí ìdájọ́ láti ọwọ́ ICJ, jẹ́ ìkẹyìn àti ìsopọ̀ lórí àwọn ẹgbẹ́, nígbà tí èyí kò rí bẹ́ẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àwọn ọ̀nà ìjọba. [Subject: International Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>bd5a63eadc5925cd2c3d...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124227 · SUBLAWCONS_Q508956</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</