ir haar en sal haar mis…hopelik is sy in ‘n beter plek.”</p></div>\n          \n        </div>\n        \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Wie het Luna as ’n frats beskryf?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Haar aanhangers</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Dustin Runnels</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Die staat se ondersoekspan</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Tommy Dreamer</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>The passage records Dustin “Goldust” Runnels saying, “Luna was just as strange as me…”, which is a clear description of Luna as “frats” (i.e., strange). Therefore, Dustin Runnels is the individual who described Luna in that way. The remaining options (her fans, the investigation team, and Tommy Dreamer) either do not make such a description or are not quoted as doing so.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> Belebele CC-BY-SA-4.0 Multilingual Shared-Passage Bank (afr_Latn) · AI_AUDITED_VERIFIED (ultra-agy:gpt-oss-120b-medium)</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>b33f29bf989f25a0af08...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124276 · SUBGSGK_Q715016</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-psg\">📖 Passage PSG_44F3DA948CE0 (Question 1 of 2)</span>\n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GS_GK — Multilingual Reading Comprehension &amp; Analytical Verbal Ability</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Multilingual Standardized Reading Comprehension (afr_Latn) (2023-2024)</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Open Multilingual Comprehension Benchmark (CC-BY-SA-4.0) · ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Aptitude &amp; Comprehension</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Shared-Passage Comprehension (afr_Latn)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Multi-Question Reading Comprehension (AFR)</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"passage-box\">\n          <div class=\"passage-hdr\">\n            <span>📖 Shared Comprehension Passage (afr_Latn)</span>\n            <span class=\"passage-tag\">Shared ID: PSG_44F3DA948CE0 · Question 1 of 2</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"passage-body\"><p>Xinhua berig dat die staat se ondersoekspan op Woensdag twee ‘black box’-vlugopnemers verhaal het. Mense stoeiers het ook hulde gebring aan Luna. Tommy Dreamer het gesê “Luna was die eerste Koningin van Uiterstes. My eerste bestuurder Luna het gesterf op die nag van twee mane. Baie uniek net soos sy. Sterk vrou.” Dustin “Goldust” Runnels het kommentaar gelewer dat “Luna was net so vreemd soos ek… dalk selfs meer…lief vir haar en sal haar mis…hopelik is sy in ‘n beter plek.”</p></div>\n          \n        </div>\n        \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Wie het na Luna as “Queen of Extreme” verwys?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Dustin Runnels</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Xinhua</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Luna se bestuurder</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Tommy Dreamer</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>In the quoted segment, Tommy Dreamer is the speaker who declares, “Luna was the first Queen of Extremes…”. This statement directly attributes the title “Queen of Extreme” to Luna, making Tommy Dreamer the person who referred to her as such. The other options—Dustin Runnels, Xinhua, and Luna’s driver—do not contain this description in the passage.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> Belebele CC-BY-SA-4.0 Multilingual Shared-Passage Bank (afr_Latn) · AI_AUDITED_VERIFIED (ultra-agy:gpt-oss-120b-medium)</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>179c96fad9a2d8c28d2a...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124275 · SUBGSGK_Q715015</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-psg\">📖 Passage PSG_AC88C3315E67 (Question 2 of 2)</span>\n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GS_GK — Multilingual Reading Comprehension &amp; Analytical Verbal Ability</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Multilingual Standardized Reading Comprehension (afr_Latn) (2023-2024)</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Open Multilingual Comprehension Benchmark (CC-BY-SA-4.0) · ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Aptitude &amp; Comprehension</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Shared-Passage Comprehension (afr_Latn)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Multi-Question Reading Comprehension (AFR)</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"passage-box\">\n          <div class=\"passage-hdr\">\n            <span>📖 Shared Comprehension Passage (afr_Latn)</span>\n            <span class=\"passage-tag\">Shared ID: PSG_AC88C3315E67 · Question 2 of 2</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"passage-body\"><p>Beide sianuriensuur en melamien is in urinemonsters gevind van troeteldiere wat dood is nadat hulle besmette troeteldierkos geëet het. Die twee verbindings reageer met mekaar om kristalle te vorm wat nier funksie mag blokkeer, het navorsers by die Universiteit gesê. Die navorsers het kristalle opgemerk wat in kat urine gevorm is deur die toevoeging van melamien en sianuriensuur. Die samestelling van hierdie kristalle is dieselfde as dié wat gevind word in die uriene van aangetaste troeteldiere wanneer dit vergelyk word onder infrarooi-spektroskopie (FITR).</p></div>\n          \n        </div>\n        \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Wat het navorsers deur middel van infrarooi spektroskopie waargeneem?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Nierfunksie</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kristalsamestelling in troeteldier-urine</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Aangetaste troeteldiere</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Besmette troeteldierkos</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>According to the passage, researchers used infrared spectroscopy (FTIR) to compare the crystals formed in cat urine with those found in the urine of affected pets, and they observed that the \"composition of these crystals is the same\". Thus, the technique revealed the <strong>crystal composition in pet urine</strong>. Options A and D describe kidney function and contaminated food, respectively, which are not what the spectroscopy measured, and C merely mentions the affected animals without specifying the observed result.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> Belebele CC-BY-SA-4.0 Multilingual Shared-Passage Bank (afr_Latn) · AI_AUDITED_VERIFIED (ultra-agy:gpt-oss-120b-medium)</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>8cccebdf3b5441f52e3b...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124274 · SUBGSGK_Q715014</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-psg\">📖 Passage PSG_AC88C3315E67 (Question 1 of 2)</span>\n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GS_GK — Multilingual Reading Comprehension &amp; Analytical Verbal Ability</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Multilingual Standardized Reading Comprehension (afr_Latn) (2023-2024)</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Open Multilingual Comprehension Benchmark (CC-BY-SA-4.0) · ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Aptitude &amp; Comprehension</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Shared-Passage Comprehension (afr_Latn)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Multi-Question Reading Comprehension (AFR)</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"passage-box\">\n          <div class=\"passage-hdr\">\n            <span>📖 Shared Comprehension Passage (afr_Latn)</span>\n            <span class=\"passage-tag\">Shared ID: PSG_AC88C3315E67 · Question 1 of 2</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"passage-body\"><p>Beide sianuriensuur en melamien is in urinemonsters gevind van troeteldiere wat dood is nadat hulle besmette troeteldierkos geëet het. Die twee verbindings reageer met mekaar om kristalle te vorm wat nier funksie mag blokkeer, het navorsers by die Universiteit gesê. Die navorsers het kristalle opgemerk wat in kat urine gevorm is deur die toevoeging van melamien en sianuriensuur. Die samestelling van hierdie kristalle is dieselfde as dié wat gevind word in die uriene van aangetaste troeteldiere wanneer dit vergelyk word onder infrarooi-spektroskopie (FITR).</p></div>\n          \n        </div>\n        \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Wat het die verbindings sianuriensuur en melamien gevorm toe hulle in kat-urine met mekaar gereageer het?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Niere</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Troeteldierkos</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kristalle</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Infrarooi spektroskopie</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>The passage explicitly reports that when cyanuric acid and melamine are mixed in cat urine they \"react with each other to form crystals\" that may block kidney function. This direct evidence points to the formation of <strong>crystals</strong> as the outcome. Options A (Kidney) and B (Pet food) describe targets or causes, not the product, while D (Infra‑red spectroscopy) refers only to the analytical method used later to identify the crystals.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> Belebele CC-BY-SA-4.0 Multilingual Shared-Passage Bank (afr_Latn) · AI_AUDITED_VERIFIED (ultra-agy:gpt-oss-120b-medium)</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>21966efc7b363d1c6948...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124273 · SUBGSGK_Q715012</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-psg\">📖 Passage PSG_3C221F0F9122 (Question 1 of 1)</span>\n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GS_GK — Multilingual Reading Comprehension &amp; Analytical Verbal Ability</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Multilingual Standardized Reading Comprehension (afr_Latn) (2023-2024)</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Open Multilingual Comprehension Benchmark (CC-BY-SA-4.0) · ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Aptitude &amp; Comprehension</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Shared-Passage Comprehension (afr_Latn)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Multi-Question Reading Comprehension (AFR)</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"passage-box\">\n          <div class=\"passage-hdr\">\n            <span>📖 Shared Comprehension Passage (afr_Latn)</span>\n            <span class=\"passage-tag\">Shared ID: PSG_3C221F0F9122 · Question 1 of 1</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"passage-body\"><p>\"Eersteminister Stephen Harper het daarop ooreengekom om die goewernment se ‘Skoon Lug Wetsontwerp’aan alle party-komitees te stuur om dit na te sien, voor dit ‘n tweede keer gelees word, na Dinsdag se 25 minute vergadering met die NDP leier Jack Layton by die PMO. Layton het vir veranderinge aan die konserwatiewes se omgewingswet gevra tydens die byeenkoms met die EM, en gevra vir 'n \"\"deeglike en algehele herskryf\"\" van die Konserwatiewe party se omgewingswet. Vandat die Federale Regering ingetree het om die befondsing van die Mersey hospitaal in Devonport, Tasmania oor te neem, het die staatsregering en sommige federale MPs die aksie gekritiseer as ‘n foefie in die aanloop tot die federale verkiesing wat in November besluit word. Maar Eerste Minister John Howard het gesê dat die akte slegs die hospitaalfasiliteite beskerm van afgegradeer te word deur die Tasmaniese regering, en sodoende ‘n ekstra AUD$45 miljoen te gee.\"</p></div>\n          \n        </div>\n        \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Wie het voorgestel dat die Skoon Lug-wetsontwerp gewysig moet word?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">John Howard</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Die Konserwatiewe Party</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Jack Layton</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Stephen Harper</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Die teks meld uitdruklik dat die NDP-leier Jack Layton veranderinge aan die wetgewing geëis het en gevra het vir ’n deeglike herskryf van die omgewingswet, wat opsie C reg bewys. Opsie D (Stephen Harper) het slegs ingestem om die wetsontwerp na komitees te verwys na die vergadering. Opsie B verwys na die regerende party wie se wet herskryf moes word, terwyl opsie A glad nie voorkom nie.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> Belebele CC-BY-SA-4.0 Multilingual Shared-Passage Bank (afr_Latn) · AI_AUDITED_VERIFIED (ultra-agy:gemini-3.8-flash-medium)</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>42bf546dd110cddebef7...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124272 · SUBGSGK_Q715011</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-psg\">📖 Passage PSG_2EC614CA2DCE (Question 2 of 2)</span>\n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GS_GK — Multilingual Reading Comprehension &amp; Analytical Verbal Ability</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Multilingual Standardized Reading Comprehension (afr_Latn) (2023-2024)</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Open Multilingual Comprehension Benchmark (CC-BY-SA-4.0) · ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Aptitude &amp; Comprehension</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Shared-Passage Comprehension (afr_Latn)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Multi-Question Reading Comprehension (AFR)</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"passage-box\">\n          <div class=\"passage-hdr\">\n            <span>📖 Shared Comprehension Passage (afr_Latn)</span>\n            <span class=\"passage-tag\">Shared ID: PSG_2EC614CA2DCE · Question 2 of 2</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"passage-body\"><p>Duvall, wie getroud is met twee volwasse kinders, het nie ‘n groot indruk op Miller, aan wie die storie verwant was, gelaat nie. Toe hy vir kommentaar gevra is, het Miller gesê, “Mike praat baie gedurende die verhoor…Ek het gereed gemaak so ek het nie regtig gehoor wat hy gesê het nie.”</p></div>\n          \n        </div>\n        \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Watter van die volgende is volgens die uittreksel waar oor Miller se ervaring tydens die verhoor?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Duvall het tydens die verhoor ’n indruk op Miller gemaak</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Hy het nie aandag gegee terwyl hy hom voorberei het nie</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Duvall se twee kinders het tydens die verhoor baie gepraat</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Hy het fyn geluister na Duvall se storie</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>In die uittreksel verduidelik Miller sy ervaring deur te noem dat hy homself gereed gemaak het en daarom nie regtig gehoor het wat gesê is nie, wat akkuraat saamgevat word deur opsie B. Opsie A is verkeerd omdat die teks vermeld dat Duvall géén 