ers to be based on the conditions before the war. The passage does not mention the military presence in the Jordan Valley or the future status of Jerusalem, so options B, C, and D are incorrect. Option A is correct as it directly refers to the passage.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> Belebele CC-BY-SA-4.0 Multilingual Shared-Passage Bank (acm_Arab) · AI_AUDITED_VERIFIED (g4f:keyless)</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>5ac356853b6facf74872...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124263 · SUBGSGK_Q713945</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-psg\">📖 Passage PSG_FAF2E20CFD99 (Question 1 of 2)</span>\n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GS_GK — Multilingual Reading Comprehension &amp; Analytical Verbal Ability</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Multilingual Standardized Reading Comprehension (acm_Arab) (2023-2024)</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Open Multilingual Comprehension Benchmark (CC-BY-SA-4.0) · ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Aptitude &amp; Comprehension</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Shared-Passage Comprehension (acm_Arab)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Multi-Question Reading Comprehension (ACM)</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"passage-box\">\n          <div class=\"passage-hdr\">\n            <span>📖 Shared Comprehension Passage (acm_Arab)</span>\n            <span class=\"passage-tag\">Shared ID: PSG_FAF2E20CFD99 · Question 1 of 2</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"passage-body\"><p>وراح تشير الوثيقة، بحسب التسريب، للخلاف على الحدود، اللي تريدها فلسطين مبنية على حدود ما قبل حرب عام 1967 بالشرق الأوسط. الموضوعات الأخرى اللي يُقال أنها تمت تغطيتها تضمن الحالة المستقبلية للقدس واللي تعتبر قضية مهمة للشعبين ومشكلة وادي الأردن. تطالب إسرائيل باستمرار التواجد العسكري بالغور لمدة عشر سنوات، بمجرد توقيع اتفاق، بينما توافق السلطة الفلسطينية على استمرار هذا التواجد لخمس سنوات فقط.</p></div>\n          \n        </div>\n        \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>بحسب الفقرة أي من المشاكل التالية ما احتوتها المذكرة؟</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">مستقبل القدس</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">سبب حدوث حرب 1967</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">وجود الجيش بالوادي</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">الخلاف على الحدود</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>The passage mentions the conflict over borders, which is based on the borders before the 1967 war in the Middle East. It also discusses the future status of Jerusalem, which is an important issue for both peoples, and the problem of the Jordan Valley. Israel consistently demands a ten-year military presence in the Jordan Valley, while the Palestinian Authority agrees to a five-year continuation of this presence. The passage does not mention the cause of the 1967 war, so option B is correct. The other options are mentioned in the passage, making them incorrect.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> Belebele CC-BY-SA-4.0 Multilingual Shared-Passage Bank (acm_Arab) · AI_AUDITED_VERIFIED (g4f:keyless)</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>4003f0816c6d9bafb504...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124262 · SUBBTBIOCH_Q713939</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-fig\">🖼️ Figure / Diagram</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_BT_BIOCHEM_MICRO — Biochemistry &amp; General Microbiology (GATE BT)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff easy\">Easy</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: N/A (N/A)</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: N/A · N/A</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> 1. Engineering &amp; Technology</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Metabolic Pathways &amp; Bioenergetics: Glycolysis, Gluconeogenesis, Pentose Phosphate Pathway</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Metabolic Pathways &amp; Bioenergetics: Citric Acid (TCA) Cycle, Glyoxylate Cycle, Oxidative Phosphorylation &amp; Ele</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Which complex of the mitochondrial electron transport chain does not pump protons from the matrix to the intermembrane space?</p></div>\n      <div class=\"q-diagram-box\"><svg viewBox='0 0 520 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect x='10' y='10' width='500' height='230' fill='#f8fafc' stroke='#94a3b8'/><text x='260' y='35' text-anchor='middle' font-size='16' fill='#1e293b'>Electron Transport Chain Proton Pumping</text><rect x='40' y='90' width='90' height='70' fill='#dbeafe' stroke='#2563eb'/><text x='85' y='120' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' fill='#1e3a8a'>Complex I</text><text x='85' y='138' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#1e3a8a'>pumps H+</text><rect x='150' y='90' width='90' height='70' fill='#fee2e2' stroke='#dc2626'/><text x='195' y='120' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' fill='#7f1d1d'>Complex II</text><text x='195' y='138' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#7f1d1d'>no H+ pump</text><rect x='260' y='90' width='90' height='70' fill='#dcfce7' stroke='#16a34a'/><text x='305' y='120' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' fill='#14532d'>Complex III</text><text x='305' y='138' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#14532d'>pumps H+</text><rect x='370' y='90' width='90' height='70' fill='#fef3c7' stroke='#d97706'/><text x='415' y='120' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' fill='#78350f'>Complex IV</text><text x='415' y='138' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#78350f'>pumps H+</text><line x1='130' y1='125' x2='150' y2='125' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='240' y1='125' x2='260' y2='125' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='350' y1='125' x2='370' y2='125' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Complex I</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Complex II</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Complex III</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Complex IV</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Complex I, Complex III, and Complex IV are proton pumps that contribute to the proton-motive force. Complex II, succinate dehydrogenase, accepts electrons from FADH2 and passes them to ubiquinone, but its free-energy change is insufficient for proton translocation. Therefore, Complex II is the correct answer.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> Open-Web BS4 Multi-Language Scraper + Pre-Dedup + Cloud AI</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>4539d470b1859ac388b4...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124261 · SUBBTBIOCH_Q713938</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_BT_BIOCHEM_MICRO — Biochemistry &amp; General Microbiology (GATE BT)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: N/A (N/A)</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: N/A · N/A</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> 1. Engineering &amp; Technology</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Metabolic Pathways &amp; Bioenergetics: Glycolysis, Gluconeogenesis, Pentose Phosphate Pathway</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Metabolic Pathways &amp; Bioenergetics: Citric Acid (TCA) Cycle, Glyoxylate Cycle, Oxidative Phosphorylation &amp; Ele</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Why does the glyoxylate cycle permit net synthesis of carbohydrate from acetyl-CoA, unlike the standard citric acid cycle?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">It bypasses both decarboxylation reactions that release CO2 in the TCA cycle.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">It converts every acetyl-CoA directly into glucose without intermediates.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">It generates more NADH than the TCA cycle per acetyl-CoA.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">It replaces succinate dehydrogenase with a proton-pumping complex.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>The glyoxylate cycle uses isocitrate lyase and malate synthase to convert two acetyl-CoA molecules into succinate while avoiding the CO2-releasing steps catalyzed by isocitrate dehydrogenase and alpha-ketoglutarate dehydrogenase. This preserves carbon for gluconeogenesis. It does not convert acetyl-CoA directly to glucose, does not primarily increase NADH yield, and does not replace succinate dehydrogenase with a proton pump. Thus, A is correct.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> Open-Web BS4 Multi-Language Scraper + Pre-Dedup + Cloud AI</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>b554c52edc933dfc023f...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124260 · SUBBTBIOCH_Q713937</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-fig\">🖼️ Figure / Diagram</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_BT_BIOCHEM_MICRO — Biochemistry &amp; General Microbiology (GATE BT)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: N/A (N/A)</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: N/A · N/A</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> 1. Engineering &amp; Technology</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Metabolic Pathways &amp; Bioenergetics: Glycolysis, Gluconeogenesis, Pentose Phosphate Pathway</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Metabolic Pathways &amp; Bioenergetics: Citric Acid (TCA) Cycle, Glyoxylate Cycle, Oxidative Phosphorylation &amp; Ele</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>In the citric acid cycle, which enzyme catalyzes the oxidative decarboxylation of isocitrate to alpha-ketoglutarate?</p></div>\n      <div class=\"q-diagram-box\"><svg viewBox='0 0 520 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect x='10' y='10' width='500' height='230' fill='#f8fafc' stroke='#94a3b8'/><text x='260' y='35' text-anchor='middle' font-size='16' fill='#1e293b'>Citric Acid Cycle: Key Decarboxylation</text><circle cx='120' cy='120' r='42' fill='#dbeafe' stroke='#2563eb'/><text x='120' y='115' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' fill='#1e3a8a'>Isocitrate</text><text x='120' y='132' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#1e3a8a'>6C</text><line x1='162' y1='120' x2='250' y2='120' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><polygon points='250,120 240,115 240,125' fill='#334155'/><text x='206' y='105' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#0f172a'>IDH</text><circle cx='300' cy='120' r='48' fill='#dcfce7' stroke='#16a34a'/><text x='300' y='112' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' fill='#14532d'>alpha-</text><text x='300' y='128' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' fill='#14532d'>Ketoglutarate</text><text x='300' y='145' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#14532d'>5C</text><text x='420' y='110' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#7c2d12'>CO2 + NADH</text><line x1='348' y1='120' x2='400' y2='120' stroke='#7c2d12' stroke-width='1.5'/><polygon points='400,120 390,115 390,125' fill='#7c2d12'/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Isocitrate dehydrogenase</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Alpha-ketoglutarate dehydrogenase</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Succinate dehydrogenase</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Malate dehydrogenase</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Isocitrate dehydrogenase oxidizes isocitrate and releases CO2, forming alpha-ketoglutarate and NADH. Alpha-ketoglutarate dehydrogenase acts on the next intermediate, not isocitrate. Succinate dehydrogenase oxidizes succinate to fumarate and does not decarboxylate. Malate dehydrogenase regenerates oxaloacetate from malate. Therefore, option A is correct.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> Open-Web BS4 Multi-Language Scraper + Pre-Dedup + Cloud AI</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>4515649603dc42bcb82e...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124259 · SUBGENCORE_Q509146</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Àwọn àṣàyàn ìlànà ààbò abẹ́lé wo ló wà fún àwọn ọlọ́lá?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àwọn olórí ẹ̀dá máa ń dá àwọn ohun tí kò dára sílẹ̀ fún àìsí ìtìlẹ́yìn fún ìjọba. Àtúnpínpín gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọ̀nà ìkọ̀sílẹ̀ fún ẹ̀ka agbára ní ọ̀nà ti &quot;ìkọ̀sílẹ̀ ẹ̀tọ́ ọmọnìyàn fún àwọn ògbóǹkangí&quot; èyí tí ó lè ní àyípadà àwọn ohun àmúṣọrọ̀, ìdádúró àti ìkọ̀sílẹ̀ àyè sí àwọn ọ̀nà ìgbòkègbodò ìṣòwò.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àìní agbára àwọn ohun èlò ìkọ́lé àti ẹ̀tọ́ àwùjọ tó gbòòrò, àwọn ọlọ́lá ìpínlẹ̀ tí kò lágbára ni wọ́n sábà máa ń fipá mú láti gbára lé agbára agbára. Síbẹ̀síbẹ̀, ìṣòro pàtàkì kan ni pé àwọn ohun èlò ìwà ipá lè jẹ́ ewu fún ìjọba tí ó nílò ìpalára mọ̀ọ́mọ̀ọ́mọ̀ fún àwọn ọmọ ogun.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àwọn ọlọ́lá gbìyànjú láti ṣe ìgbéga ìṣèlú ìdánimọ̀ tuntun nínú èyí tí ìmọ̀ ẹ̀yà rọ́pò nípasẹ̀ àwọn èrò tí ó ní ìtọ́sọ́nà nípa ìtàn àròsọ ìjọba.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àwọn ìpínlẹ̀ tí kò lágbára ti ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn àgbáyé tí wọ́n sì ti bẹ̀rẹ̀ àwọn ìlànà àtúnṣe ìjọba tiwa-n-tiwa kí wọ́n lè gba ẹ̀tọ́ gbogbo ènìyàn nínú nígbà tí wọ́n ń ṣe ìgbélárugẹ ẹ̀tọ́ àgbáyé rẹ̀ ní ìta.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) Àìní agbára àwọn ohun èlò ìkọ́lé àti ẹ̀tọ́ àwùjọ tó gbòòrò, àwọn ọlọ́lá ìpínlẹ̀ tí kò lágbára ni wọ́n sábà máa ń fipá mú láti gbára lé agbára agbára. Síbẹ̀síbẹ̀, ìṣòro pàtàkì kan ni pé àwọn ohun èlò ìwà ipá lè jẹ́ ewu fún ìjọba tí ó nílò ìpalára mọ̀ọ́mọ̀ọ́mọ̀ fún àwọn ọmọ ogun. [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>e585faa6676207affd55...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124258 · SUBGENCORE_Q509145</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ní àwọn ọ̀nà wo, tí ó bá wà, ṣé àyíká lè jẹ́ àníyàn ààbò?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ààbò àyíká ń mú kí àgbéyẹ̀wò ààbò àyíká àgbáyé, pẹ̀lú àwọn ètò-ìpínlẹ̀ tí ó wà nínú rẹ̀ àti àwọn ètò àjọ tí ó wà ní ẹ̀yìn ààlà orílẹ̀-èdè.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Aabo ayika jẹ iṣẹ akanṣe aabo to ṣe pataki ni pe o beere tani ati kini lati ni aabo ati lati iru irokeke wo nipasẹ awọn eto imulo aabo, tabi boya awọn asopọ laarin ayika, aabo ati awọn ọran idagbasoke le ṣee ṣe.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ààbò àyíká jẹ́ ìgbésẹ̀ tó wúlò láti ṣàyẹ̀wò bí àyíká ṣe ń yí padà tó sì ń fa rògbòdìyàn láàárín àwọn orílẹ̀-èdè àti láàárín àwọn orílẹ̀-èdè, àti àwọn ọ̀nà tí ààbò àyíká lè gbà ba ààbò orílẹ̀-èdè jẹ́.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Gbogbo awọn aṣayan wọnyi. Àyíká náà jẹ́ nkan tí a gbọ́dọ̀ dáàbò bo àti orísun ewu, bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé ó lè túmọ̀ sí oríṣiríṣi nkan sí oríṣiríṣi ènìyàn. Bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé ó ń mú kí èrò ààbò jinlẹ̀ ó ní ìwọ̀n tó ṣe pàtàkì tí ó sì wúlò bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé ìwúlò èrò náà jẹ́ ìfigagbága.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Gbogbo awọn aṣayan wọnyi. Àyíká náà jẹ́ nkan tí a gbọ́dọ̀ dáàbò bo àti orísun ewu, bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé ó lè túmọ̀ sí oríṣiríṣi nkan sí oríṣiríṣi ènìyàn. Bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé ó ń mú kí èrò ààbò jinlẹ̀ ó ní ìwọ̀n tó ṣe pàtàkì tí ó sì wúlò bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé ìwúlò èrò náà jẹ́ ìfigagbága. [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>54813cb653df05a7e0e9...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124257 · SUBGENCORE_Q509143</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Látìgbà tí Ogun Tutu ti parí, báwo ni ọ̀nà tí àwọn orílẹ̀-èdè tó ń ṣàkóso nílẹ̀ Yúróòpù ń gbà lo ọgbọ́n ìṣèlú tó ń múni ṣe ohun tí kò tọ́ ṣe ti yí padà?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Iṣẹ́-ìfipá-nipasẹ̀-ẹ̀rí ti fi hàn pé ó jẹ́ ọ̀nà ìṣèlú tó ṣàṣeyọrí àti èyí tí ó jẹ́ apá pàtàkì nínú ètò ìdarí ìjà. Àwọn àṣeyọrí tí àwọn ìgbésẹ̀ ètò ìṣèlú tó ti kọjá ní àwùjọ lẹ́yìn 9/11 ti mú ìyípadà sí ọ̀nà ìfọ̀rọ̀wánilẹ́nuwò lílágbára lágbára nípa mímú ìfẹ́ ọkàn ìṣèlú Amẹ́ríkà pọ̀ sí i láti kojú ìpániláyà tí ó ń mú ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ènìyàn ṣòfò ní àwọn orílẹ̀-èdè tí ó ń kùnà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ayika agbegbe-iṣelu ti o wuyi, ti o jẹ afihan nipasẹ agbara giga ologun ti Iwọ-oorun ti o lagbara pupọ ati eewu kekere ti idasi agbara nla ọta, ti ṣe ipilẹṣẹ awọn igara ati awọn iwuri fun awọn oluṣeto imulo Iwọ-oorun lati ṣe agbega ero eto imulo wọn, ati lati ṣakoso awọn ija ologun lati awọn ipinlẹ alailagbara ati awọn ipinlẹ ti kuna.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ìparun ìyapa èrò orí tí ó pín àwùjọ àgbáyé sí méjì nígbà Ogun Abẹ́lé, dípò kí ó yọrí sí dídín ìjà kù, ó fi ogún tí kò dúró sán-ún sílẹ̀ níbi tí òṣèlú nípa lílo agbára àti ìgbẹ̀san tí ó pọ̀jù ti ń bá a lọ láti jẹ́ ewu gidi. Ewu ti ilosoke ti ko ni iṣakoso ṣi wa ṣugbọn ni ọna ti o yatọ; Ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìwà ìbàjẹ́ ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀, àkóràn láti àwọn ìpínlẹ̀ tí ó kùnà àti àwọn òṣèré tí kì í ṣe ti ìpínlẹ̀ tí wọ́n ń wá ọ̀nà láti gba WMD ni àníyàn àkọ́kọ́ fún àwọn ìpínlẹ̀ tí wọ́n sì nílò ìdáhùn ní ìrísí ìgbésẹ̀ àwọn ológun.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àyíká ọ̀tá tó wà láyìíká àwọn orílẹ̀-èdè ti mú kí àwọn orílẹ̀-èdè máa lo ọgbọ́n ológun kí wọ́n lè dáàbò bo àwọn ohun tó jẹ àwọn lógún. Lílo ìwà ipá dípò ìfọ̀rọ̀wéròwérò tàbí ìwúrí ti di ìdáhùn àkọ́kọ́ sí àwọn ewu, yálà àwọn wọ̀nyí jẹ́ èyí tí àwọn orílẹ̀-èdè mìíràn gbé kalẹ̀, àìtó àwọn ohun àmúṣọrọ̀, àwọn àrùn tó ń ranni, tàbí àwọn ewu mìíràn tí kì í ṣe ti ìbílẹ̀.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) Ayika agbegbe-iṣelu ti o wuyi, ti o jẹ afihan nipasẹ agbara giga ologun ti Iwọ-oorun ti o lagbara pupọ ati eewu kekere ti idasi agbara nla ọta, ti ṣe ipilẹṣẹ awọn igara ati awọn iwuri fun awọn oluṣeto imulo Iwọ-oorun lati ṣe agbega ero eto imulo wọn, ati lati ṣakoso awọn ija ologun lati awọn ipinlẹ alailagbara ati awọn ipinlẹ ti kuna. [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>1582b208a37b81f1d9ff...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124256 · SUBGENCORE_Q509140</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Kini awọn okunfa ti ipanilaya?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ìjọba ìjọba orílẹ̀-èdè àti ìfẹ́ orílẹ̀-èdè ń dènà àfààní fún ìpànìyàn: ìfẹ́ orílẹ̀-èdè ń pèsè agbára èrò láti ṣe ìṣọ̀kan ìyàtọ̀ ẹ̀yà, àti pé ìjọba tiwa-n-tiwa ń gba ààyè fún àlàyé àwọn ìkórìíra ní ọ̀nà tí ó dára. Láàárín àtúpalẹ̀ yìí àwọn ìpínlẹ̀ tí wọ́n ní ìwé-ẹ̀rí ìjọba ìjọba àti olùfẹ́ orílẹ̀-èdè tí kò lágbára lè pèsè àwọn ipò tí ó ń ṣe ìrànlọ́wọ́ fún ìdàgbàsókè ìpànìyàn.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ìwà ìbàjẹ́ láàárín àwọn ẹgbẹ́ Mùsùlùmí ni wọ́n ṣe àgbékalẹ̀ rẹ̀ lórí àwọn ìlà ẹ̀yà tí ó tako ẹ̀sìn tí ó tẹ̀lé ìgbàlódé. Ó lè jẹ́ ohun ìyàlẹ́nu pé bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé wọ́n ṣètò ìpànìyàn ní àyíká ìdẹ́rùbà sí àwùjọ Mùsùlùmí ní Àárín Ìlà Oòrùn, ìdáhùn sí ìdẹ́rùbà ti yọrí sí àwọn ẹgbẹ́ ní Europe tí wọ́n ní ìdẹ́rùbà nípasẹ̀ ìfọwọ́sowọ́pọ̀ àwọn Mùsùlùmí lórí àwọn ìwà Ìwọ̀ Oòrùn.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àwọn iṣẹ́ ọjà olówó-nkan àti ìyípadà ìmọ̀-ẹ̀rọ àti ìbánisọ̀rọ̀ ti pọ̀ sí i lórí àṣà àti àwùjọ ìbílẹ̀. Àìdọ́gba ìdàgbàsókè àti ìyàsọ́tọ̀ àwọn ẹ̀yà tàbí ètò ọrọ̀ ajé kan nínú àwọn ènìyàn, pẹ̀lú ìmọ̀ tí ó ń pọ̀ sí i nípa ìyàsọ́tọ̀ wọn ń pèsè ìdí fún ìbísí ìwà ipá.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn eto ijọba ti kii ṣe tiwantiwa ti o ṣe afihan nipasẹ eto aarin ti o lagbara ati awọn ọna ipaniyan ṣii aaye fun ibanujẹ ti o gbajumọ lati yipada si awọn iṣẹ apanilaya ti iṣiṣẹ pẹlu ero lati pari eto iṣelu. Bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé àwọn àfààní fún ìkópa àwọn ènìyàn nínú àwọn ìjọba olómìnira ń dènà àìtẹ́lọ́rùn àwọn ènìyàn láti ṣàlàyé rẹ̀ ní ọ̀nà tí kò dára.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Àwọn iṣẹ́ ọjà olówó-nkan àti ìyípadà ìmọ̀-ẹ̀rọ àti ìbánisọ̀rọ̀ ti pọ̀ sí i lórí àṣà àti àwùjọ ìbílẹ̀. Àìdọ́gba ìdàgbàsókè àti ìyàsọ́tọ̀ àwọn ẹ̀yà tàbí ètò ọrọ̀ ajé kan nínú àwọn ènìyàn, pẹ̀lú ìmọ̀ tí ó ń pọ̀ sí i nípa ìyàsọ́tọ̀ wọn ń pèsè ìdí fún ìbísí ìwà ipá. [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>7d5ed9c1d89edb0cdf43...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124255 · SUBGENCORE_Q509138</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Kí ni Àwọn Ìwádìí Ààbò Tó Ṣe Kókó?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ọ̀nà sí ààbò tí ó kan ìmọ̀ tó ṣe kókó fún àwọn ẹ̀sìn olódodo tí wọ́n ti fìdí múlẹ̀ fún ìwádìí ààbò.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ìlànà ààbò pàtó tí ó ń ṣe ìdánimọ̀ àwọn aṣojú tí a ṣàlàyé kedere, ìdẹ́rùbà, àti ìlànà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ọ̀rọ̀ kejì fún Copenhagen School of Security.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ààbò ìwádìí nínú èyí tí ó ṣe pàtàkì fún ìpínlẹ̀, àwọn ológun àti ààbò ìbílẹ̀ wà ní ìtọ́jú.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Ọ̀nà sí ààbò tí ó kan ìmọ̀ tó ṣe kókó fún àwọn ẹ̀sìn olódodo tí wọ́n ti fìdí múlẹ̀ fún ìwádìí ààbò. [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>e15d66dc9946d2b7ca22...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124254 · SUBGENCORE_Q509137</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ọ̀rọ̀ wo ló ṣàpèjúwe ìwà Booth sí ìkọ́lé àti lẹ́yìn ìṣètò láàárín Àwọn Ìwádìí Ààbò Tó Ṣe Kókó?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Lẹ́yìn ìṣètò kò pèsè ìpìlẹ̀ kankan fún ìgbésẹ̀ òṣèlú, jíjẹ́ àpòpọ̀ ewu ti ìwà ìbàjẹ́ èké, ìbáṣepọ̀ àti ìkọ̀kọ̀, nígbà tí ìkọ́lé jẹ́ ìlànà sí òṣèlú àgbáyé dípò ìlànà òṣèlú pàtó.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Constructivism ń pèsè ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn ìlànà òṣèlú pàtó tí ó wúlò fún Àwọn Ìwádìí Ààbò Tó Ṣe Kókó ṣùgbọ́n gbogbo àwọn wọ̀nyí kò ní àìlágbára tí a nílò nínú ìwádìí ààbò. Àwọn ìlànà lẹ́yìn ìṣètò bákan náà kò ní agbára tí àwọn ọ̀mọ̀wé CSS fẹ́.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Lẹ́yìn ìṣètò àti ìkọ́lé jẹ́ àwọn ìlànà tí kò ní ìtumọ̀ tí wọ́n ṣàpèjúwe rẹ̀ dáadáa gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìlànà òṣèlú, tí ó wúlò ní àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ tí kò dára ṣùgbọ́n tí kò ní nkan tí àwọn ọ̀mọ̀wé nílò nínú ìwádìí ààbò ìgbàlódé.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Constructivism léwu jù àpòpọ̀ àwọn èrò òṣèlú, àpapọ̀ àwọn èròjà ìdàgbàsókè àti ìbáṣepọ̀. Lẹ́yìn ìṣètò jẹ́ ìlànà sí òṣèlú àgbáyé dípò ìlànà òṣèlú pàtó tí ó sì wúlò.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Lẹ́yìn ìṣètò kò pèsè ìpìlẹ̀ kankan fún ìgbésẹ̀ òṣèlú, jíjẹ́ àpòpọ̀ ewu ti ìwà ìbàjẹ́ èké, ìbáṣepọ̀ àti ìkọ̀kọ̀, nígbà tí ìkọ́lé jẹ́ ìlànà sí òṣèlú àgbáyé dípò ìlànà òṣèlú pàtó. [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>90715d1496390bf6cbe3...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124253 · SUBGENCORE_Q509132</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Public Relations</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Public Relations (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Public Relations</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ó jẹ́ olùdarí ìbánisọ̀rọ̀ fún apa ibi kan ní ilé iṣẹ́ tí kìíṣe ti èyí tó wà fún èrè jíjẹ tí ó jẹ ara ilé iṣẹ́ ńlá ti orílẹ̀ èdè tí kìíṣe èyí tó wà fún èrè jíjẹ. Wọ́n máa ńsáàbà béèrè lọ́wọ́ rẹ pé kí o ṣètò ìtànkálẹ̀ ìròyìn nípa lílo àwọn àgbéjáde ìròyìn tí olú ilé iṣẹ́ orílẹ̀ èdè pèsè rẹ̀ tó wà ní ìpínlẹ̀ míràn. Irúfẹ́ ìgbésẹ̀ wo ni ó máa ṣe ìgbélárugẹ fún ànfààní tí ó ní láti ṣe àṣeyọrí pẹ̀lú àwọn ohun èèlò wọ̀nyí?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Lo àwọn àjọṣe tí ó ní pẹ̀lú àwọn afúnni ti ìbílẹ̀ láti jèrè ìtànkálẹ̀ ìròyìn.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Mú àwọn àgbéjáde ìròyìn náà láti jẹ́ ti èdè abínibí fún àwọn èèrò nínú àyíká rẹ.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Pè àwọn àgbéjáde ìròyìn gẹ́gẹ́ bí a ti kọ wọ́n sílẹ̀, ṣùgbọ́n ṣàfikún ọ̀rọ̀ láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùdarí àgbà ti abala tí o wà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Mú kí àwọn olóòtù rántí wípé ilé iṣẹ́ rẹ jẹ́ tí orílẹ̀ èdè, tí kìíṣe èyí tó wà fún èrè jíjẹ pàtàkì tí olùtẹ̀wéjáde wọn máa ńfún ní nnkan.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) Mú àwọn àgbéjáde ìròyìn náà láti jẹ́ ti èdè abínibí fún àwọn èèrò nínú àyíká rẹ. [Subject: Public Relations · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>e55feb1ef63a84208872...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124252 · SUBGENCORE_Q509131</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Public Relations</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Public Relations (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Public Relations</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Irúfẹ́ gbólóhùn wo ni ó jẹ́ òtítọ́ nípa ẹgbẹ́ àfojúsùn ìwádìí?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àwọn olùkópa ni kí á yàn ní àìlétò.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ó jẹ́ àpẹẹrẹ irinṣẹ́ ìwádìí ti ọ́fíìsì fún àwọn olùkópa.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àlàyé náà ṣeé sọ di gbogboogbò láti ṣe àpèjúwe iye àwọn ènìyàn tó pọ̀.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àwọn àbájáde ń ṣe àmúwá dáta tó yanrantí tí a lè lò láti fi mú ìdàgbàsókè bá àwọn ìwádìí</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Àwọn àbájáde ń ṣe àmúwá dáta tó yanrantí tí a lè lò láti fi mú ìdàgbàsókè bá àwọn ìwádìí [Subject: Public Relations · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>a644cfd3fc451cdfad9a...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124251 · SUBHUMPSYC_Q509125</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_HUM_PSYCHOLOGY — Psychology (Cognitive, Developmental, Social, Clinical &amp; Research Methods)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Humanities</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Psychology (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Psychology</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Èwo nínú àwọn gbólóhùn tó wà nísàlẹ̀ yìí ló ṣàpèjúwe ojúṣe àwọn olùṣèwádìí nípa lílo àwọn ẹranko nínú ìwádìí nípa ìrònú àti ìhùwàsí?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">A ò gbọ́dọ̀ lo àwọn ẹranko fún ìwádìí nígbàkigbà tá a bá rí àwọn ọ̀nà mìíràn láti ṣe ìwádìí.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kò yẹ kí wọ́n máa lo àwọn ẹranko fún ìwádìí tí ìwádìí náà bá máa kó wọn sí yọ́ọ́yọ́ọ́ tàbí kó ìdààmú bá wọn.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ó lè jẹ́ pé bí àwọn ẹranko bá ní ìrora tàbí tí wọ́n bá ní ìdààmú ọkàn, ìyẹn lè mú kí wọ́n ṣe ìwádìí, àmọ́ kìkì ìgbà tí wọn kò bá rí ọ̀nà míì (tí kì í dunni) tí ìwádìí náà sì lè wúlò gan-an ni.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ó bófin mu láti máa dá àwọn ẹranko lóró tàbí láti máa kó wọn sí wàhálà nígbà tí wọ́n bá ń ṣe ìwádìí, àmọ́ kìkì tí wọ́n bá dín in kù, tí wọ́n sì pa wọ́n ní kíákíá bó bá ti lè ṣeé ṣe tó.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Ó lè jẹ́ pé bí àwọn ẹranko bá ní ìrora tàbí tí wọ́n bá ní ìdààmú ọkàn, ìyẹn lè mú kí wọ́n ṣe ìwádìí, àmọ́ kìkì ìgbà tí wọn kò bá rí ọ̀nà míì (tí kì í dunni) tí ìwádìí náà sì lè wúlò gan-an ni. [Subject: Professional Psychology · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>921c499f0a8031606f6b...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124250 · SUBHUMPSYC_Q509116</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_HUM_PSYCHOLOGY — Psychology (Cognitive, Developmental, Social, Clinical &amp; Research Methods)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Humanities</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Psychology (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Psychology</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>A gba Ọ̀mọ̀wé A Praise síṣẹ́ láti ṣe àyẹ̀wò kan tí ilé ẹjọ́ pàṣẹ rẹ̀ fún olùjẹ́jọ́ kan nínú ẹjọ́ ìwà ọ̀daràn kan. Ó jíròrò nípa èrèdí àyẹ̀wò náà pẹ̀lú olùjẹ́jọ́ náà tí ó wá sọ pé òun kò fẹ́ fi ọwọ́ so ọwọ́ pọ̀. Gẹ́gẹ́ bí àwọn Ìtọ́sọ́nà Ìkọ́ṣẹ́mọṣẹ́ fún Ìmọ̀ Ọpọlọ ti Ìwádìí, ó yẹ kí Ọmọ̀wé Praise:</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">rán olùjẹ́jọ́ náà létí pé kò sí ṣíṣe kò sí àìṣe níwọ̀n bí ó ti jẹ́ pé ilé ẹjọ́ ni ó pàṣẹ àyẹ̀wò náà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">kọ̀ láti ṣe àyẹ̀wò náà àyàfi tí ó bá gba fọ́ọ̀mù ìfọwọ́sí kan tí a bu ọwọ́ lù láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùjẹ́jọ́ náà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">kọ̀ láti se àyẹ̀wò náà àyàfi tí ó bá gba fọ́ọ̀mù ìfọwọ́sí kan tí a bu ọwọ́ lù láti ọ̀dọ̀ agbẹjọ́rò olùjẹ́jọ́ náà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">sún àyẹwò náà síwájú kí ó sì gba olùjẹ́jọ́ náà ní ìmọ̀ràn láti kàn sí agbẹjọ́rò rẹ̀.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) sún àyẹwò náà síwájú kí ó sì gba olùjẹ́jọ́ náà ní ìmọ̀ràn láti kàn sí agbẹjọ́rò rẹ̀. [Subject: Professional Psychology · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>01b92f82c696c0c5b4c4...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124249 · SUBLAWCONS_Q509111</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">COUNTRY_LOCAL: United States</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_LAW_CONST — Constitutional &amp; Administrative Law</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Law</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Law (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Law</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Awọn obinrin meji ngbe ni ile iyẹwu kan pẹlu 20 aja. Ẹ̀rù ba ajá-ẹlẹ́sẹ̀ kan tí wọ́n wọ inú ilé náà nítorí ipò ìgbésí ayé wọn tó burú jáì. Ẹ̀jẹ̀ àwọn ẹran náà ni a kó sí gbogbo ilé náà, wọ́n kó wọn sínú àpótí kéékèèké, àwọn ẹranko kan sì ń ṣàìsàn. Alejo ti a npe ni SPCA, a ikọkọ ti kii-èrè awujo eda eniyan. Ofin ipinlẹ fun awọn awujọ omoniyan laṣẹ lati gba awọn ẹranko ti o ni ilokulo tabi ti a gbagbe lati ọdọ awọn oṣiṣẹ iṣakoso ẹranko, lati tọju wọn ati gba wọn jade. SPCA mu awọn ẹranko ti a yan nipasẹ awọn alaṣẹ. Awọn olori lẹhinna mu awọn obinrin fun aibikita ẹranko. Nígbà ìgbẹ́jọ́ kan, agbẹjọ́rò náà kò múra sílẹ̀, adájọ́ sì fagi lé ẹ̀sùn náà. Awọn obinrin lẹhinna fi ẹsun awọn oṣiṣẹ ati SPCA labẹ 42 U.S.C. Â§ 1983 fun awọn ẹtọ ilu. Awọn olujebi SPCA fi ẹsun kan lati yọ kuro da lori isansa ti “igbese ipinlẹ” ni apakan wọn. Njẹ ile-ẹjọ yoo jẹ ki o gba ẹjọ lati yọ kuro?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Bẹẹni, nitori ko si ohun ti o ṣe nipasẹ awujọ eniyan ti o kan igbese ọlọpa.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Bẹẹni, nitori awọn oṣiṣẹ SPCA ko ṣe ni eyikeyi akoko “labẹ awọ ofin” ninu awọn iṣe wọn.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Rara, nitori pe a ṣeto SPCA labẹ iwe-ẹri ti kii ṣe èrè ti isọdọkan ti ipinlẹ ti funni.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Rara, nitori SPCA ṣiṣẹ labẹ aṣẹ ti ofin ipinlẹ ati ifowosowopo pẹlu awọn alaṣẹ ipinlẹ lati ṣe awọn iṣẹ ti a fun ni aṣẹ.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Rara, nitori SPCA ṣiṣẹ labẹ aṣẹ ti ofin ipinlẹ ati ifowosowopo pẹlu awọn alaṣẹ ipinlẹ lati ṣe awọn iṣẹ ti a fun ni aṣẹ. [Subject: Professional Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>c69fe7ee09df705991cb...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124248 · SUBLAWCONS_Q509109</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_LAW_CONST — Constitutional &amp; Administrative Law</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Law</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Law (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Law</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Lakoko awọn ọjọ ikẹhin ti Alakoso rẹ, ọpọlọpọ awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ Igbimọ Alakoso bẹrẹ jijo kuku awọn itan didamu nipa Alakoso si awọn oniroyin. Ninu ọkan iru itan bẹẹ, eyiti o han ninu iwe iroyin kan, ọmọ ẹgbẹ minisita ti a ko mọ ni a sọ pe Alakoso dariji oniwun ti ẹgbẹ bọọlu afẹsẹgba kan, fun idalẹjọ ẹṣẹ ti iṣaaju nitori oluwa ti ṣe ileri lati fun Alakoso ni igbesi aye igbesi aye si gbogbo ọjọ iwaju. awọn ere. Ibinu nipasẹ awọn iroyin wọnyi “awọn n jo,” Alakoso, ninu iṣe aṣẹ rẹ ti o kẹhin, ti paṣẹ aṣẹ alaṣẹ ti o fi ofin de gbogbo awọn oṣiṣẹ alaṣẹ lati ni ibaraẹnisọrọ pẹlu awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ ti atẹjade ayafi ti igbanilaaye iṣaaju ti gba lati ọdọ alabojuto iṣakoso kan. Aṣẹ alaṣẹ pe fun yiyọ kuro ti oṣiṣẹ eyikeyi ti o mọọmọ ni ilodi si aṣẹ yẹn. Lẹhin ti Alakoso ti lọ kuro ni ọfiisi, awọn atẹjade ṣe awọn itọkasi leralera si aṣẹ alaṣẹ ati pe o tọka si i bi ogún ti Alakoso. Sibẹsibẹ, lẹhin ti Aare titun ti gba ọfiisi o ṣe ileri lati tẹle aṣẹ naa. Lẹ́yìn náà, ọ̀kan lára ​​àwọn olùdámọ̀ràn àgbà fún Igbakeji Ààrẹ, jo ìtàn kan sí ìwé ìròyìn kan tí ó sọ pé Igbákejì Ààrẹ sọ fún àwọn òṣìṣẹ́ rẹ̀ pé ìdí kan ṣoṣo tí ó fi ṣèbẹ̀wò sí ìlú kan lẹ́yìn ìmìtìtì ilẹ̀ kan ni nítorí pé ó fẹ́ ṣe gọ́ọ̀bù ní ibi ìdánilẹ́kọ̀ọ́ gọ́ọ̀bù kan nítòsí. Iwe irohin naa tẹjade itan naa o si sọ agba agba-imọran gẹgẹbi orisun. Ni ibamu pẹlu awọn ilana iṣẹ ilu, igbọran kan ni a ṣe ati pe oludamoran agba ni a rii pe o ti ṣẹ aṣẹ alase ti o dena awọn ibaraẹnisọrọ laigba aṣẹ pẹlu media titẹjade. Lẹhinna, oludamoran agba ti yọkuro ni ṣoki lati ipo oṣiṣẹ alaṣẹ rẹ. Oludamọran agba mu igbese ti o yẹ wa ti n wa imupadabọ ati koju ofin t’olofin ti aṣẹ alaṣẹ. Ti ẹjọ yii ba de ile-ẹjọ giga ti AMẸRIKA, awọn onidajọ yẹ ki o ṣe akoso aṣẹ alase jẹ</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">t&#x27;olofin, nitori oojọ ti ijọba jẹ anfani ati kii ṣe ẹtọ.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">t&#x27;olofin, nitori Aare ni agbara gbogbo lati ṣeto awọn ilana iṣẹ fun awọn oṣiṣẹ ẹka alaṣẹ.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">aiṣedeede, nitori Ile asofin ijoba, kii ṣe Alakoso, ni aṣẹ lati ṣe ilana awọn ofin ati ipo ti oojọ apapo.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">alaigbagbọ, nitori Aare ko le fi opin si gbogbo ominira ti ọrọ-ọrọ ati ajọṣepọ ti gbogbo awọn oṣiṣẹ alaṣẹ.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) alaigbagbọ, nitori Aare ko le fi opin si gbogbo ominira ti ọrọ-ọrọ ati ajọṣepọ ti gbogbo awọn oṣiṣẹ alaṣẹ. [Subject: Professional Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>8fe689e64eb77a5e3c61...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124247 · SUBLAWCONS_Q509106</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_LAW_CONST — Constitutional &amp; Administrative Law</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Law</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Law (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Law</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Èwo nínú àwọn ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ wọ̀nyí ni ó ṣeé ṣe kí ìwà olùjẹ́jọ́ mú un jẹ́ ẹni tó jẹ̀bi ẹ̀sùn ọ̀daràn fún ikú olùfaragbà.</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Olùjẹ́jọ́ kan yín ìbọn fún olùfaragbà lórí. Wọ́n gbé olùfaragbà náà lọ sí ilé-ìwòsàn fún ìtọ́jú ọgbẹ́ náà. Lẹ́yìn náà Ilẹ̀ ríri kan kọlu ìlú náà, tí ó jẹ́ kí ilé ìwòsàn náà wó lulẹ̀. Olùfaragbà náà ni àwókù ilé náà wó pa.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Olùjẹ́jọ́ kan àti olùfaragbà kan jọ ń gbé nínú ilé kan. Olùjẹ́jọ́ náà mọ̀ wípé olùfaragbà náà  ń ní àjọṣepọ̀ ìfẹ́ pẹ̀lú obìnrin tó ti gbéyàwó. Ní ọjọ́ kan, olùjẹ́jọ́ náà gbọ́ wípé ọkọ obìnrin yìí fẹ́ pa olùfaragbà náà. Bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ wípé olùjẹ́jọ́ náà ní àkókò tó pọ̀ láti kìlọ̀ fún olùfaragbà náà, ó kọ̀ láti ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀. Ní alẹ́ ọjọ́ náà, ọkọ arábìnrin yìí fi ọ̀bẹ gùn olùfaragba náà pa.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Olùfaragbà kan, tí ó jẹ́ atatẹ́tẹ́, jẹ́ àwọn jàǹdùkú ní gbèsè tó pọ̀ gan-an. Olùjẹ́jọ́ kan, tó jẹ́ ògbóǹkangí àwọn jàǹdùkú, ń halẹ̀ mọ́ ọkùnrin náà pé òun yóò pá tí kò bá san owó tó jẹ́. Pẹ̀lú ìbẹ̀rù, olùfaragbà náà wọ ọkọ̀ òfuurufú to kan kúrò ní ìlú. Ọkọ̀ òfuurufú náà já, ó sì pa olùfaragbà náà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Olùjẹ́jọ́ kan àti olùfaragbà kan jọ ń wa ọkọ̀ papọ̀ lọ sí ibi iṣẹ́ nígbà tí olùjẹ́jọ́ náà, fi ọbẹ̀ gún un ní apá láì ṣe ohunkóhun láti bíi nínú. Olùjẹ́jọ́ náà tì í jáde kúrò nínú ọkọ̀ ayọ́kẹ́lẹ́ náà. Olùfaragbà náà ṣubú sí ẹ̀gbẹ́ ọ̀nà ó sì fọ́ ní kókósẹ̀. Nítorí pé kò lè dìde kúrò láàárín ọ̀nà, ọkọ̀ ayọ́kẹ́lẹ́ kan tí awakọ̀ tó ti mutí yó kan ń wà tẹ olùfaragbà náà pa ní ǹkan bíi ọgbọ̀n-ìṣẹ́jú lẹ́yìn náà.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Olùjẹ́jọ́ kan àti olùfaragbà kan jọ ń wa ọkọ̀ papọ̀ lọ sí ibi iṣẹ́ nígbà tí olùjẹ́jọ́ náà, fi ọbẹ̀ gún un ní apá láì ṣe ohunkóhun láti bíi nínú. Olùjẹ́jọ́ náà tì í jáde kúrò nínú ọkọ̀ ayọ́kẹ́lẹ́ náà. Olùfaragbà náà ṣubú sí ẹ̀gbẹ́ ọ̀nà ó sì fọ́ ní kókósẹ̀. Nítorí pé kò lè dìde kúrò láàárín ọ̀nà, ọkọ̀ ayọ́kẹ́lẹ́ kan tí awakọ̀ tó ti mutí yó kan ń wà tẹ olùfaragbà náà pa ní ǹkan bíi ọgbọ̀n-ìṣẹ́jú lẹ́yìn náà. [Subject: Professional Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>57172926adc2e04cab48...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124246 · SUBLAWCONS_Q509105</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_LAW_CONST — Constitutional &amp; Administrative Law</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Law</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Law (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Law</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ọkùnrin kan wá gba ayàwòrán fídíò síṣẹ́ láti ya fídíò ìgbéyàwó ọmọbìnrin rẹ̀. Ìwé àdéhùn tí wọ́n kọ sínú ìwé náà ní &quot;ọ̀rọ̀ kan nínú tó sọ pé wọ́n máa &quot;san <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>10,000 fún fídíò ìgbéyàwó náà àti àpèjẹ náà fún odindi ìṣẹ́jú 60.” Ọkùnrin náà fi kún ìwé àdéhùn náà pé àwọn ohun èlò tó ní ìtumọ̀ gíga ló máa fi ṣe fídíò náà. Àdéhùn náà kò mẹ́nu kan àwọn nǹkan mìíràn tó ní í ṣe pẹ̀lú owó ìtaràn. Lẹ́yìn náà, ayàwòrán náà ya fídíò náà tó gùn tó ìṣẹ́jú 60, ó sì tún un ṣe, ó lo àwọn ohun èlò tó ń mú kí fídíò náà ṣe kedere, ó sì fi hàn án fún ọkùnrin náà. Lẹ́yìn náà, ayàwòrán fídíò náà fún ọkùnrin náà ní ẹ̀rí owó tó jẹ́ </mi></mrow></math>15,000. Yàtọ̀ sí iye tí wọ́n san fún iṣẹ́ náà, ìyẹn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>10,000, owó tí wọ́n fi gba àwọn ẹ̀rọ gíga fíìmù náà jẹ́ </mi></mrow></math>5,000. Èwo nínú àwọn àríyànjiyàn tó wà nísàlẹ̀ yìí ló ṣeé ṣe jù lọ láti tì ayàwòrán lẹ́yìn nínú àlàyé rẹ̀ pé nígbà tí ìwé àdéhùn tí wọ́n kọ sílẹ̀ náà bá wáyé, ọkùnrin náà gbà láti san <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>5,000 fún ayàwòrán fídíò fún lílo àwọn ohun èlò gíga-ìtumọ̀ láfikún sí owó </mi></mrow></math>10,000?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Níbàámu pẹ̀lú àṣà ìṣòwò tó wọ́pọ̀ lágbo iṣẹ́ fídíò, owó tí wọ́n máa ń san fún fídíò yíyà tó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>10,000 túmọ̀ sí pé wọ́n á san </mi></mrow></math>10,000 lẹ́yìn owó àfikún tí wọ́n máa ń san bí wọ́n bá lo àwọn ẹ̀rọ tó ń gbé àwòrán jáde lọ́nà tó ṣe kedere.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àdéhùn tí wọ́n bá ṣe ní ẹnu, tí wọ́n bá lè fi hàn pé ó wà níbàámu, yóò wulẹ̀ jẹ́ àfikún, kì í ṣe àtakò sí &quot;àlàkalẹ̀ ìsanwó&quot; tí wọ́n kọ.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Lábẹ́ àwọn òfin tó ń ṣàkóso káràkátá ọjà ní orílẹ̀-èdè Amẹ́ríkà, tí àwọn ẹ̀rí tí kò fojú hàn bá wà, àwọn àlàyé míràn tí ẹgbẹ́ méjèèjì jọ fara mọ́ jẹ́ ìtẹ́wọ́gbà àyàfi tí àwọn àlàyé náà “bá yàtọ̀ tàbí lòdì sí àwọn èyí tó wà nínú àdéhùn àkọsílẹ̀ náà.”</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Nítorí àríyànjiyàn wípé “àkọsílẹ̀ nípa bí a ṣe ń sanwó” jẹ́ síso papọ̀ tí kò sì hàn gbangba pé kò ṣe kedere tàbí ohun tí ó ṣe kedere, ohun tí ó yẹ kí wọ́n ṣe pèsè fún lílo àwọn ẹ̀rí tí kò fojú hàn tí wọ́n bá wà fún àǹfààní àwọn ẹ̀gbẹ́ méjèèjì tí ọ̀rọ̀ náà kan, nígbà tí ó jẹ́ wípé olùyafídíò náà yóò pàdánù ẹgbẹ̀rún márùn-ún dọ́là (USD 5,000) lórí àdéhùn àkọsílẹ̀ náà.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Níbàámu pẹ̀lú àṣà ìṣòwò tó wọ́pọ̀ lágbo iṣẹ́ fídíò, owó tí wọ́n máa ń san fún fídíò yíyà tó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>10,000 túmọ̀ sí pé wọ́n á san </mi></mrow></math>10,000 lẹ́yìn owó àfikún tí wọ́n máa ń san bí wọ́n bá lo àwọn ẹ̀rọ tó ń gbé àwòrán jáde lọ́nà tó ṣe kedere. [Subject: Professional Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>caccbdebae29e2b5b98f...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124245 · SUBLAWCONS_Q509104</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_LAW_CONST — Constitutional &amp; Administrative Law</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Law</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Law (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Law</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ní ọjọ́ ìṣẹ́gun, onílé kan ra ohun ẹ̀rọ ìgéko tuntun kan ní ilé ìtajà. Ní ọjọ́ kejì, ó ń gé koríko ní ẹ̀yìn ilé rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rọ náà nígbà tí òjò bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí ní rọ̀. Ó dẹkùn lílo ẹ̀rọ náà o sì pa. Ó wọ inú ilé lọ, ó sì dúró kí òjò náà dá kí ó tó tẹ̀síwájú láti gé àwọn koríko tó kù. Lẹ́yìn ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ nígbà tí onílé náà wà nínú ilé rẹ̀, lójijì ẹ̀rọ ìgéko náà lọ síwájú láìsí fúnra rẹ̀, ó yí já bọ́ láti òkè kan, ó sì wọ ilẹ̀ aládùúgbò rẹ̀. Ẹ̀rọ náà gé àwọn igi róòsì to ṣe iyebíye, ó sì bà wọ́n jẹ́. Lẹ́yìn náà ni wọ́n rí wípé ohun tí wọ́n fi ń tan ẹ̀rọ náà ti bàjẹ́. Bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé onílé náà tí ti fi ohun tí wọ́n fi ń pa ẹ̀rọ náà sì ipò pípa, síbẹ̀ ẹ̀rọ náà sì wà ní títàn. Nítorí wípé ẹ̀rọ tó ń yípo tí kò ní ariwo ni wọ́n fi ṣe ẹ̀rọ ìgéko náà, kò sì ìdí tí onílé náà yó fi mọ̀ pé ẹ̀rọ náà ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ nígbà tí òun wọ inú ilé. Kò sí bí onílé náà yóò ṣe mọ̀ pé ẹ̀rọ náà ní àléébù nípa ṣíṣe àyẹ̀wò. Tí aládùúgbò náà bá fi ẹ̀sùn ìkọjá àyè kan ọkùnrin onílé náà, ṣe aládùúgbò náà yóò borí?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni, nítorí pé ẹ̀rọ ìgéko náà wọ inú ilẹ̀ aládùúgbò náà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni, nítorí pé onílé náà ní ẹ̀tọ́ láti sanwó fún ìpalára tí ẹ̀rọ tó bàjẹ́ náà fà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Rárá, nítorí pé ẹni tó ni ilé náà ń lo ẹ̀rọ ìgéko náà fún ète tí wọ́n yàn fún un.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Rárá, nítorí pé wọn kò ṣàwárí ohun tí wọ́n fi ń pá ẹ̀rọ náà, èyí tó  ti bàjẹ́, lára ẹ̀rọ nípa ṣíṣe àyẹ̀wò.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Rárá, nítorí pé wọn kò ṣàwárí ohun tí wọ́n fi ń pá ẹ̀rọ náà, èyí tó  ti bàjẹ́, lára ẹ̀rọ nípa ṣíṣe àyẹ̀wò. [Subject: Professional Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>fb48468a1d639a126c55...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124244 · SUBCOMFINA_Q509100</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_COM_FIN_ACC — Financial &amp; Corporate Accounting</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Commerce</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Accounting (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Accounting</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Èwo nínú àwọn ìgbésẹ̀ tó wà nísàlẹ̀ yìí ni olùṣirò oníṣe ní láti fi sínú ètò àyèwò láti ṣe àyèwò tó gbéṣẹ́ jù lọ nígbà tí oníbàárà tó ń ṣe àyèwò bá ń lo àjọ tí ń pèsè iṣẹ́ fún àwọn ìgbésẹ̀ bíi mélòó kan?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ṣe àgbéyẹ̀wò ìròyìn tí olùṣirò iṣẹ́ náà kọ nípa àwọn àbójútó tí wọ́n ṣe nínú àwọn iṣẹ́ náà.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ṣe àtúnyẹ̀wò ìròyìn olùṣirò iṣẹ́, kó o sì ṣàkọsílẹ̀ ètò ìṣirò náà nínú ìwé ìránnilétí kan tó wà nínú àwọn ìwé iṣẹ́</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ṣíṣe àyẹ̀wò àwọn ètò tí àjọ tó ń pèsè iṣẹ́ ìsìn náà ń lò, dídánwò ewu, àti mímú ètò àyẹ̀wò náà ṣe.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ṣíṣe àyẹ̀wò àwọn ètò tí àjọ tó ń bójú tó ètò náà ń lò láti fi dán iṣẹ́ tí olùṣirò ètò náà ṣe wò.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Ṣe àgbéyẹ̀wò ìròyìn tí olùṣirò iṣẹ́ náà kọ nípa àwọn àbójútó tí wọ́n ṣe nínú àwọn iṣẹ́ náà. [Subject: Professional Accounting · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>8c2cdb5c21431fb38971...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#124243 · SUBCOMFINA_Q509098</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_COM_FIN_ACC — Financial &amp; Corporate Accounting</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Commerce</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Accounting (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Accounting</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ilé iṣẹ́ kan npèsè àwọn ìwé ìṣúná rẹ̀ lórí ìpìlẹ̀ owó orí lórí owó tí ó nwọlé. Lára àwọn àkíyèsí tí ó pẹ̀lú rẹ̀ ni ìkádìí àwọn ìlànà ìṣírò owó tí ó lápẹẹrẹ tí ó nṣe ìjíròrò lórí ìpìlẹ̀ ìfihàn ó sì nṣe àpèjúwe bí ìpìlẹ̀ yẹn ti yàtọ̀ sí GAAP. Iye owó dọ́là ti àwọn ipa ìyàtọ̀ láarín ìpìlẹ̀ owó orí lórí owó tí ó nwọlé àti GAAP</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \">